**Fix:** in docs/plans/WP-SCP-024-estate-cascade.md §9 D-044 reservation, amend the language. Two options — pick the cleaner one:

**Option A (preferred):** acknowledge the substitution. Replace 'invocation-log convention extension: scaffolder writes a rendered-template log entry alongside enable-required-check.sh's branch-protection log' with: 'scaffolder MANIFEST.json local audit: emitted alongside the wrapper + CODEOWNERS-snippet + CASCADE-PR-BODY artefacts, listing every emitted file + SHA256. The original §9 reservation language called for a 'rendered-template log entry alongside branch-protection-log.md' but this was reframed during 024B-core authoring (2026-05-09) — local MANIFEST.json provides the same forensic-traceability surface (per-emission SHA256 audit) without coupling to the branch-protection-log file (which is reserved for enable-required-check.sh per D-035). The branch-protection-log entry remains the operator's responsibility per cascade-slice (cohort 024C+).'

